   version 3.0pl10 on disk 460.  Includes source.
   Author:  Various; see documentation

#824
AlphMan
   A programmer tool which may help you to create an intuition or
   gadtools user interface.  It opens a window with a gadget for
   each keyboard key.  If you press a key the dependent gadget
   will be disabled.  So you may check whether a key has been
   used or not.  Requires AmigaDOS 2.04 or higher.  Version 1.00,
   freeware, binary only.
   Author:  Hans-Peter Guenther

GadgetTest
   A programming example of how to create and handle all of the
   types of the new AmigaDOS 2.04 gadgets.  Requires AmigaDOS
   2.04 or higher.  This is version 0.01, includes source.
   Author:  Hans-Peter Guenther

NetHack
